{"seq":2,"slug":"ttl-stale-swr","title":"TTL 与 stale-while-revalidate","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-query-cache-warmup/invalidation-freshness/ttl-stale-swr","wordCount":2543,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"ttl-与-stale-while-revalidate\">TTL 与 stale-while-revalidate</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>TTL 是缓存里最简单的参数，也是最难定的参数。它同时承担两个互相冲突的职责：<strong>作为新鲜度的上界承诺</strong>（条目最旧不会超过 TTL）和<strong>作为主动失效的兜底</strong>（即使失效通路漏了，TTL 之后数据也会自愈）。TTL 定得短，这两项都更好，代价是命中率下降、回源量上升；定得长，反过来。</p>\n<p>这个取舍有一个常被忽略的维度：<strong>TTL 的取值不应该由「数据多久变一次」决定，而应该由「数据变旧多少是可接受的」决定。</strong> 这两个数在很多场景下差了一个量级。一个商品的价格可能每分钟都在变，但用户看到一分钟前的价格在绝大多数场景下是可接受的（只要在结算前校验）。把它们混同起来，会导致 TTL 被定得过短，缓存收益被白白抵消。</p>\n<p>TTL 的第二个作用——防止「永久错误」——决定了它有一个硬下界：<strong>它必须短于业务的容错窗口</strong>。如果业务能接受「最多五分钟的旧数据」，那么 TTL 无论如何不能超过五分钟，即使这段时间内没有发生任何变更事件。这个上界是设计 TTL 时的第一个约束，其他考量都在它之下。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  R[读请求] --&gt; H{缓存有值?}&#10;  H --&gt;|无| M[回源计算]&#10;  H --&gt;|有| F{是否过期?}&#10;  F --&gt;|未过期| FR[返回新鲜值]&#10;  F --&gt;|软过期| SWR[立即返回旧值&lt;br/&gt;后台异步刷新]&#10;  F --&gt;|硬过期| M&#10;  M --&gt; W[写入缓存]&#10;  W --&gt; FR&#10;  SWR --&gt; BG[后台刷新任务]&#10;  BG --&gt; W\">graph TD\n  R[读请求] --&gt; H{缓存有值?}\n  H --&gt;|无| M[回源计算]\n  H --&gt;|有| F{是否过期?}\n  F --&gt;|未过期| FR[返回新鲜值]\n  F --&gt;|软过期| SWR[立即返回旧值&lt;br/&gt;后台异步刷新]\n  F --&gt;|硬过期| M\n  M --&gt; W[写入缓存]\n  W --&gt; FR\n  SWR --&gt; BG[后台刷新任务]\n  BG --&gt; W</pre><p>这张图引入了<strong>软过期与硬过期</strong>的区分，这是让 TTL 同时兼顾新鲜度与延迟的关键机制。一条缓存条目在它的生命周期里经过三个阶段：<strong>新鲜期</strong>（返回并认为准确）、<strong>软过期 / 陈旧可用期</strong>（立即返回旧值，同时触发后台刷新）、<strong>硬过期</strong>（必须同步回源）。软过期窗口的存在让「条目刚好过期」这一瞬间的请求不必同步等待回源，而是拿到一个「稍微旧一点但立刻可用」的值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"stale-while-revalidate-的语义与来源\">stale-while-revalidate 的语义与来源</h2><p>「立即返回旧值 + 后台异步刷新」这套语义在 HTTP 层已经被标准化，是 <code>Cache-Control</code> 的 <code>stale-while-revalidate</code> 扩展指令：它声明在条目过期后的一段额外时间内，缓存可以先返回陈旧响应，同时在后台异步验证。同时还有 <code>stale-if-error</code> 指令，声明在后端返回错误时可以返回陈旧响应（来源：RFC 5861, &quot;HTTP Cache-Control Extensions for Stale Content&quot;, <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5861）。这两条语义在搜索查询缓存里完全适用，而且用得比\">https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5861）。这两条语义在搜索查询缓存里完全适用，而且用得比</a> HTTP 层更激进——因为搜索回源的代价远大于在 CDN 层取一次。</p>\n<p>把这两个窗口加起来，一条条目的总有效寿命可以写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>fresh</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>swr</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>sie</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{total}} = T_{\\text{fresh}} + T_{\\text{swr}} + T_{\\text{sie}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fresh</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">swr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sie</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>swr</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{swr}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">swr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是陈旧可用窗口，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>sie</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{sie}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sie</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是错误时可用的窗口。三个窗口对应三种不同的承诺：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>fresh</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{fresh}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fresh</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 内承诺准确；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>swr</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{swr}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">swr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 内承诺可用但可能陈旧；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>sie</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{sie}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sie</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 内只在下游失败时使用（这与 <a href=\"../hot-query-warmup/popular-fallback-cache\">热门兜底缓存</a> 是同一思路在同一层内的实现）。</p>\n<p>分窗口设计的直接好处是：<strong>让 TTL 的硬下界由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>fresh</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T\\_{\\text{fresh}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fresh</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 承担，而命中率由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>total</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T\\_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 承担。</strong> 业务要求「最多五分钟的旧数据」，那么 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>fresh</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{fresh}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fresh</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 设五分钟，但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>swr</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{swr}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">swr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可以再设五分钟——用户在第六分钟到第十分钟内拿到的仍是可用结果，只是我们在后台刷新它。这比直接把 TTL 设成十分钟要好得多，因为承诺没有被打破。</p>\n<h2 id=\"请求合并与刷新风暴\">请求合并与刷新风暴</h2><p><code>stale-while-revalidate</code> 解决了一个用户拿到结果的问题，但同时制造了一个新问题：<strong>软过期条目在窗口内的所有请求都会触发后台刷新</strong>。如果这个键在窗口内被请求一万次，就可能产生一万次并发的后台刷新——这正是缓存击穿（见 <a href=\"../cache-protection/penetration-breakdown-avalanche\">穿透、击穿与雪崩三件套防护</a>），只不过发生在后台而不是前台。</p>\n<p>因此 <code>stale-while-revalidate</code> 必须与<strong>请求合并（request coalescing / single-flight）</strong> 一起用。合并的做法是：对每个键维护一个「正在刷新」的标记，第一个触发刷新的请求真正去回源，后续请求看到标记就直接返回旧值、不触发新的刷新。实现形态有三种：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>进程内合并</strong>：用一个本地字典记录正在刷新的键。它只能合并单个进程内的请求，多实例部署下每个实例仍会各刷新一次。适用于实例数不多或回源代价可接受的场景。</li>\n<li><strong>分布式合并</strong>：用缓存本身或一个共享存储实现「谁抢到了刷新权」的互斥。典型做法是 <code>SET key value NX PX &lt;租约时长&gt;</code> 抢锁，拿到锁的实例负责刷新，其余返回旧值。需要处理「持锁者崩溃」的情况——租约时长就是为此存在的。</li>\n<li><strong>粗粒度合并</strong>：不按单个键合并，而是按「刷新任务」合并——把一段时间内需要刷新的键收集起来批量回源。适合可以批量计算的场景（例如一批查询可以被同一个批量接口处理），能进一步降低回源次数。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[请求到达&lt;br/&gt;条目软过期] --&gt; L{抢刷新锁&lt;br/&gt;NX PX 租约}&#10;  L --&gt;|抢到| FETCH[回源计算]&#10;  L --&gt;|未抢到| OLD[返回旧值]&#10;  FETCH --&gt; W[写入新值]&#10;  FETCH --&gt; REL[释放锁]&#10;  OLD --&gt; RESP[响应]&#10;  W --&gt; RESP&#10;  REL -.-&gt;|失败则租约超时| L\">graph TD\n  A[请求到达&lt;br/&gt;条目软过期] --&gt; L{抢刷新锁&lt;br/&gt;NX PX 租约}\n  L --&gt;|抢到| FETCH[回源计算]\n  L --&gt;|未抢到| OLD[返回旧值]\n  FETCH --&gt; W[写入新值]\n  FETCH --&gt; REL[释放锁]\n  OLD --&gt; RESP[响应]\n  W --&gt; RESP\n  REL -.-&gt;|失败则租约超时| L</pre><p>合并的收益随 QPS 增长而非线性——在低流量时段合并几乎没有意义（争抢本身就消耗一次往返），在高流量时段它把刷新次数从「键被访问的次数」压到「键的数量」。因此合并机制应当是可开关的，并要求 QPS 达到阈值才启用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ttl-抖动与雪崩防护\">TTL 抖动与雪崩防护</h2><p>一批键如果在同一时刻被写入，它们会在同一时刻过期。当这批键是预热写入的（几万个键在几秒内被批量灌入），后果就是在 TTL 到期的瞬间几万个键同时失效，全部请求涌向下游——这是雪崩最经典的成因，而且它完全由「TTL 相同」这一个设计选择造成。</p>\n<p>解法是<strong>TTL 抖动（jitter）</strong>：实际写入的 TTL 是基准值加一个随机偏移，例如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = T_0 \\cdot (1 + \\delta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, \\alpha]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 上均匀分布。这一改动把「同时过期」变成「在一个区间内均匀过期」，使回源量从尖峰变成平滑的斜坡。抖动系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 的取值通常在 5%–20% 之间：太小则尖峰仍然尖锐，太大则一部分条目的 TTL 被显著缩短而降低平均命中率。</p>\n<p>值得强调的是抖动的<strong>反直觉之处</strong>：它看似破坏了 TTL 的承诺（「TTL 最长是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>」变成了「最长是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_0(1+\\alpha)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>」）。因此抖动应该向下取而不是向上取（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = T_0 \\cdot (1 - \\delta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>），或者把基准值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/(1+\\alpha)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 折算后再加上抖动，这样抖动只缩短不延长，承诺得以保持。</p>\n<p>对于本来就没有规律可言的随机请求，抖动无副作用；对于预热写入的批量条目，抖动是必需的。此外，<strong>抖动必须在写入时施加而不是在配置时施加</strong>——如果 TTL 配置成一个随机范围，每次读取都要重新解释它，且缓存系统自己的过期判断与业务理解会不一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ttl-分层的实际做法\">TTL 分层的实际做法</h2><p>真实系统的 TTL 不是单一数值，而是一张按条目类型分层的表。分层的维度有三个：<strong>内容类型</strong>（描述类字段可以旧，价格库存必须新）、<strong>查询热度</strong>（热点词值得更短的 TTL，因为它的回源代价被复用次数摊薄，而它对体验的影响面最大）、<strong>写入来源</strong>（预热写入的条目 vs 正常回源的条目，前者可以携带更长的 TTL，因为它没有「刚刚计算过」的时间基准）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条目类型</th>\n<th>新鲜期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>fresh</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{fresh}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fresh</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>陈旧窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>swr</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{swr}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">swr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>抖动</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>热点词查询结果</td>\n<td>1–5 分钟</td>\n<td>5–15 分钟</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>影响面大，值得更频繁刷新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长尾词查询结果</td>\n<td>10–60 分钟</td>\n<td>1–4 小时</td>\n<td>20%</td>\n<td>重访率低，回源代价高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品描述类字段</td>\n<td>1–6 小时</td>\n<td>12–24 小时</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>变更频率低且不易被用户察觉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格 / 库存字段</td>\n<td>0–30 秒</td>\n<td>30–120 秒</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n<td>必须接近实时，见第三章第三节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预热写入的条目</td>\n<td>按相应类型 + 提前量</td>\n<td>同类型</td>\n<td>20%</td>\n<td>无「刚算过」基准，留足余量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负缓存条目</td>\n<td>30–120 秒</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>20%</td>\n<td>见第四章第二节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的绝对值只是量级示例，真正要传递的是<strong>分层这个动作本身</strong>：如果一份缓存里所有条目的 TTL 都是一个数，那么它必然在某些类型上太短（浪费）而在另一些上太长（不安全）。TTL 应当与「内容变更速率」和「读方对陈旧的容忍度」这两个维度挂钩，并且这两个维度都应当在缓存的元数据里被显式记录，以便事后审计「这份承诺是否合理」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>TTL 的取值应由「旧多少可接受」而非「多久变一次」决定；它同时承担新鲜度上界与主动失效兜底两个职责，且必须短于业务的容错窗口。</li>\n<li>把条目寿命拆成新鲜期、陈旧可用期（stale-while-revalidate）、错误可用期（stale-if-error）三个窗口，能让硬承诺由新鲜期承担而命中率由总寿命承担；这两条指令是 RFC 5861 定义的标准语义。</li>\n<li>陈旧窗口会让所有请求触发后台刷新，必须与请求合并（进程内、分布式租约锁、或批量刷新）一起使用，否则陈旧窗口内就是一次后台击穿。</li>\n<li>TTL 抖动是防止批量条目同时失效的必需手段；抖动应只缩短不延长，且必须在写入时施加而非在配置里表达为范围。</li>\n<li>TTL 必须分层：按内容类型、查询热度、写入来源分别设定，分层本身比具体数值更重要。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"TTL 与 stale-while-revalidate","id":"ttl-与-stale-while-revalidate"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"stale-while-revalidate 的语义与来源","id":"stale-while-revalidate-的语义与来源"},{"level":2,"text":"请求合并与刷新风暴","id":"请求合并与刷新风暴"},{"level":2,"text":"TTL 抖动与雪崩防护","id":"ttl-抖动与雪崩防护"},{"level":2,"text":"TTL 分层的实际做法","id":"ttl-分层的实际做法"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"索引与商品变更导致的缓存失效","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-query-cache-warmup/invalidation-freshness/index-change-invalidate"},"next":{"title":"缓存新鲜度 SLA：价格与库存的特殊处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-query-cache-warmup/invalidation-freshness/cache-freshness-sla"}}